
---

# 3. `.gitignore`

Before Flutter generates its normal `.gitignore`, use this small initial version:

```gitignore
# Operating systems
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# Environment and secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties
service-account*.json

# Temporary files
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp

# Codex/local work
.codex/

.claude/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
**/doc/api/
/build/
migrate_working_dir/

# IntelliJ related
*.ipr
*.iws

# Miscellaneous
*.class
*.pyc
.atom/
.buildlog/
.history
.svn/
